    {
      "name": "Merchant",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/environment/settlement/market-stall.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Lamp oil? Rope? Bombs? You want it? It’s yours my friend, as long as you have enough rubies.</strong></p><p><em>—Morshu, Link: The Faces of Evil</em></p><p>May they be an appraiser of rare magic items, peddler of illicit substances, or bookkeeper for the court, merchants are masters of exchange.</p><h3>Iconic Merchants</h3><ul><li><strong>Anna</strong>, <em>Fire Emblem</em></li><li><strong>Marco Polo</strong>, <em>Venetian merchant</em></li><li><strong>Torneko Taloon</strong>, <em>Dragon Quest IV</em></li><li><strong>Tressa Colzione</strong>, <em>Octopath Traveler</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Merchant</h3><p>The merchant is a low-defense and damage character, who provides high-support through a wider inventory pool and optimizing your party’s resources. In combat, you should look out for allies in need of assistance and strategize what items to use.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Use<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Flexible (skip to Use)<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Blacksmith, Cook, or Tinker<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Luck/Reason<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Craft, Finesse, Influence</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Gold Sink, Deep Pockets</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Line Goes Up (+1 Luck)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Diamond Hands (+1)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Line Goes Up (+2 Luck), Opportunist</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Diamond Hands (+2)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Line Goes Up (+3 Luck), Midas Touch</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": false,
        "manaMultiplier": 0,
        "manaSkill": null,
        "castingStat": null,
        "keyStats": [
          "luck",
          "reason"
        ],
        "skillGrant": {
          "guaranteed": [
            "craft",
            "finesse",
            "influence"
          ],
          "choices": []
        },
        "levelFeatures": [
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Gold Sink",
            "description": "<p>You can take the Use Action to place Item(s) that aren’t Fabled Relics inside a container and choose one Item with a value no higher than the Item(s) placed inside. The chosen Item replaces the originals. If the value exceeds 1g, you must spend 1 Luck to do so.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
          },
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Deep Pockets",
            "description": "<p>You gain the Deft Hands Perk (p. 68), and you gain 2 extra Item Slots now and every 3 Levels hereafter.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [
              "Compendium.vagabond.perks.Item.vtNfeEdWNUWvaeRM"
            ],
            "perkAmount": 1,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
          },
          {
            "level": 2,
            "name": "Line Goes Up (+1 Luck)",
            "description": "<p>You gain 1 Luck during a Breather and when you spend a Shift to Craft or Travel.</p><p>Further, when you Rest, you gain 1 extra Luck. This extra Luck gained from a Rest increases by 1 every 4 Levels hereafter.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 1,
            "extraTraining": 0,
            "requiredSpells": [],
            "allowedPerks": [],
            "perkAmount": 0,
            "spellAmount": 0,
            "skillChoices": []
